# Financial Analytics Dashboard

## Overview

The Insurance Financial Analytics Dashboard (IFAD) is a single, production-grade dashboard for reviewing insurance portfolio performance. It was selected from three prototypes (Conservative, Modern, Creative) — **the Conservative design was chosen**.

**Routes:**
- `/analytics` — main dashboard (`ConservativeDashboard.jsx`)
- `/analytics/:assetId` — asset drill-down detail (`ConservativeAssetDetail.jsx`)
- `/dashboard-conservative` and `/dashboards` → redirect to `/analytics` (legacy)

