## Data Layer — `financialMockData.js`

All data is **mock/generated** — no external API calls. Singleton caches prevent regeneration on re-render.

### Exports

| Export | Returns | Description |
|--------|---------|-------------|
| `getMonthlyData()` | `MonthlyRecord[]` | Last 12 months of premiums/claims, cached |
| `getAssetData()` | `Asset[]` | 25 assets (10 Property, 15 Auto), cached |
| `getAssetById(id)` | `Asset \| undefined` | Lookup single asset by ID |
| `calculateYTDStats(monthly, assets)` | `YTDStats` | YTD aggregates + loss ratio |
| `generateClaimHistory(assetId, category)` | `Claim[]` | 0–4 claims per asset |
| `generatePolicyDocuments(assetId)` | `PolicyDoc[]` | 3 static docs per asset |

### Asset ID Format
- Property: `PROP-0001` through `PROP-0010`
- Auto: `AUTO-0011` through `AUTO-0025`

### Data Shape

```javascript
// Asset
{
  id: 'PROP-0001',
  assetName: '123 Maple St Warehouse',
  assetCategory: 'Property' | 'Auto',
  location: 'Portland, OR',      // null for Auto
  vin: 'ABC123...',              // only on Auto assets
  premiumDue: 4200,
  dueDate: '2025-06-15',
  totalClaims: 18500,
  policyNumber: 'P000123',
  coverageAmount: 2000000,
  deductible: 10000,
}

// MonthlyRecord
{
  month: 'Jan',
  year: 2025,
  monthYear: 'Jan 2025',
  propertyPremiums: 87000,
  propertyClaims: 59160,
  autoPremiums: 66500,
  autoClaims: 47880,
}
```

