## Dashboard Architecture — `ConservativeDashboard.jsx`

### State

| State | Type | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| `chartType` | `'line' \| 'bar'` | Toggled chart type |
| `page` | number | Current pagination page |
| `pageSize` | number | Rows per page (default 20) |
| `filterCategory` | `'all' \| 'property' \| 'auto'` | Category dropdown filter |
| `searchQuery` | string | Search input (raw) |

### Key Patterns

**Module-level constants** — `TABLE_HEADERS`, `BASE_CHART_OPTIONS`, `CHART_COLOR_SCALE` are defined outside the component to avoid object recreation on every render.

**Sanitized search** — `searchQuery` is sanitized via `sanitizeInput()` before use in filter logic. `sanitizedSearch` is computed with `useMemo` and placed before `filteredAssets` in the file to avoid temporal dead zone errors.

**Memoization chain:**
```
monthlyData → chartData
assetData   → categoryCounts
            → filteredAssets (depends on filterCategory + sanitizedSearch)
              → paginatedAssets (depends on page + pageSize)
                → tableRows
```

**Stable callbacks** — `handleRowClick`, `handleRowKeyDown`, `handleSearch`, `handleCategoryChange`, `handlePaginationChange` are all wrapped in `useCallback`.

**Keyboard navigation** — Table rows have `tabIndex={0}`, `role="button"`, and `onKeyDown` handlers so keyboard users can navigate with Tab + Enter/Space.

