## Asset Detail Architecture — `ConservativeAssetDetail.jsx`

- Reads `:assetId` from URL params (`useParams`)
- Renders a "not found" fallback Tile if the ID doesn't match any asset
- Sections: Policy Information, Claim Summary, Claim History table, Policy Documents list
- Claim status → Carbon Tag type mapping via `getStatusTagType()` helper

---

## Styling Conventions

- **Mobile-first**: base padding `var(--spacing-03)` (8px), scales to `var(--spacing-06)` (24px) at `42rem` (672px)
- **Chart overflow**: `overflow-x: auto` with `min-width: 500px` on mobile, removed at tablet
- **All tokens**: uses `var(--token-name)` from `src/styles/tokens/` — no hardcoded colors
- **Visually hidden**: `.visually-hidden` utility class defined in `ConservativeDashboard.scss` for screen-reader-only text

