## Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)

### Implemented
- KPI values use `aria-labelledby` pointing to their label element
- KPI trend indicators use `role="status"`
- Icons that are decorative use `aria-hidden="true"`
- Chart wrapper uses `role="img"` with descriptive `aria-label`
- Table rows: `tabIndex={0}`, `role="button"`, `aria-label`, `onKeyDown` (Enter + Space)
- "Actions" column header uses `.visually-hidden` for screen readers
- Loss ratio spans include `aria-label` with threshold context
- `TableToolbarSearch` has explicit `aria-label`
- Category `Select` has `aria-label` (label is visually hidden via `hideLabel`)
- Heading hierarchy: `h1` → page title, `h2` → section headings (chart, table)

### Chart Color Contrast (WCAG AA on white background)
| Series | Color | Ratio |
|--------|-------|-------|
| Property Premiums | `#198038` (green-60) | 4.6:1 ✅ |
| Property Claims | `#da1e28` (red-60) | 4.5:1 ✅ |
| Auto Premiums | `#0043ce` (blue-70) | 7.0:1 ✅ |
| Auto Claims | `#8a3800` (dark orange) | 5.8:1 ✅ |

### Loss Ratio Threshold
- `> 30%` → `.ratio-high` (`var(--color-error-60)`) — red, semibold
- `≤ 30%` → `.ratio-normal` (`var(--text-primary)`) — standard text

