## Security

- **Input sanitization**: `sanitizeInput()` strips `< > " ' &` from search input before it is used in filter comparisons. Raw value is never rendered as HTML.
- **Route params**: `assetId` from URL is used only to look up data from the in-memory mock array — no eval, no dangerouslySetInnerHTML, no external fetch.
- **No user data persisted**: all data is ephemeral mock data; no localStorage, cookies, or API calls.
- **XSS**: all user-provided values are passed to React's virtual DOM (not innerHTML), so React's built-in escaping applies.

---

## Performance

- Data generators run once and cache via module-level variables (`monthlyDataCache`, `assetDataCache`)
- All expensive derivations are wrapped in `useMemo`
- Event handlers are stable via `useCallback`
- `TABLE_HEADERS` and `BASE_CHART_OPTIONS` are module-level constants (not recreated per render)
- `categoryCounts` is memoized to avoid two inline `filter()` calls in JSX

---

## Navigation

Header has a top-level **"Analytics"** `HeaderMenuItem` linking to `/analytics`. No submenu needed — single dashboard.

Side nav mirrors the same single entry under `HeaderSideNavItems`.

